---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Renovation Guide - 1120pa Community Hub" description="Guidelines for renovation works at 1120 Park Avenue">
  <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
    <ol class="breadcrumb">
      <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Guides</li>
      <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Renovation Guide</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <h1 class="mb-4">Renovation Guide</h1>

  <div class="alert alert-warning">
    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle me-2"></i>
    <strong>Notice:</strong> All renovation works must comply with Management Office guidelines and approved procedures.
  </div>

  <div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100">
        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
          <h5 class="mb-0"><i class="bi bi-clipboard-check me-2"></i>Before You Start</h5>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h6>Requirements:</h6>
          <ul class="list-group mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item">Submit renovation application form to Management Office</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Pay required deposits (varies by scope of work)</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Provide detailed floor plans and work schedule</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Obtain written approval before commencing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100">
        <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
          <h5 class="mb-0"><i class="bi bi-clock me-2"></i>Work Hours</h5>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p>Renovation works are typically permitted during:</p>
          <table class="table table-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Day</th>
                <th>Hours</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Monday - Friday</td>
                <td>9:00 AM - 6:00 PM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Saturday</td>
                <td>10:00 AM - 4:00 PM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Sunday & Public Holidays</td>
                <td>Not permitted</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <h3><i class="bi bi-truck me-2"></i>Service Elevator Booking</h3>
  <div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="card-body">
      <p>For moving heavy materials, you must book the service elevator in advance:</p>
      <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered mb-3">
        <li class="list-group-item">Request booking through the Management Office at least <strong>24 hours</strong> in advance</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Pay the service elevator deposit (refundable upon completion)</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Arrive on time with your booking slip</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Maximum capacity must be observed for safety</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3><i class="bi bi-list-check me-2"></i>Common Guidelines</h3>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-header text-success">
          <i class="bi bi-check-circle me-2"></i>Allowed
        </div>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
          <li class="list-group-item">Minor repairs and repainting</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Flooring replacement (tiles, laminate)</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Electrical rewiring (certified electrician)</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Plumbing modifications</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Built-in furniture installation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card mb-3">
        <div class="card-header text-danger">
          <i class="bi bi-x-circle me-2"></i>Not Allowed Without Special Approval
        </div>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
          <li class="list-group-item">Structural modifications</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Hacking of walls or columns</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Altering sewage/waste systems</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Installing additional water points</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">High-noise works on weekends</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">
    <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i>
    <strong>Tip:</strong> Provide your contractors with a copy of the House Rules & Regulations. Ensure they know the evacuation routes and emergency procedures.
  </div>

  <hr />

  <div class="card bg-light">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h5><i class="bi bi-question-circle me-2"></i>Need Clarification?</h5>
      <p>For renovation inquiries, contact the Management Office during working hours.</p>
      <a href="/#contacts" class="btn btn-primary">View Contact Numbers</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>